{
  "topic_id": "t-mm-06-022",
  "book_id": "book-mm-06",
  "title": "17.5. DEEP VEIN THROMBOSIS:",
  "source_sha256": "f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605",
  "block_count": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-06-022\" hidden></div>\n<h3 class=\"mm-heading mm-h3 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9165]\" style=\"background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>17.5. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>DEEP VEIN THROMBOSIS:</span></h3>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9166]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Prevention and trhomboprophylaxis</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9167]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>DVT</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9168]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Symptoms:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9169]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pain</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9170]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Swelling</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9171]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Erythema</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9172]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Signs:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9173]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Low grade temperature</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9174]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Leg swollen, warmer</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9175]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Peripharal veins distal to occlusion may appear distorted</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9176]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tender to palpation.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9177]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Investigations:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9178]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Compression duplex USG</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9179]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Primary diagnostic test with 87% sensitivity </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9180]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Vein is visualized by using B \u2013 mode USG</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9181]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Vein is compressed by the transducer, if vein fails to collapse and intraluminal clot is present, even if it can\u2019t be visualized.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9182]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Compression duplex USG</strong></span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"e2f65ec1ffbf44fd1b8b1153\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-022\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure e2f65ec1ffbf44fd1b8b1153\" viewbox=\"933450 152400 1390650 361950\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"e6a18a62bf6923988ecf81da64ca4d0fb7cf6bd003ad8f9d40761cf2e168ef00\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-b60502dcba883a81f0a8\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker><marker id=\"arrow-end-932ba70386610df5e026\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"b60502dcba883a81f0a8\" transform=\"translate(1016000 196850)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(114300 101600) rotate(0) scale(-1 1) translate(-114300 -101600)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 228600 203200\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-b60502dcba883a81f0a8)\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"932ba70386610df5e026\" transform=\"translate(1993900 196850)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 215900 177800\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-932ba70386610df5e026)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9183]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Positive</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>negative</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9184]\"><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>+ High suspicion </strong></em></span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"bdcce8352c1aa1efdd80d887\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-022\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure bdcce8352c1aa1efdd80d887\" viewbox=\"1409700 114300 1143000 514350\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"e7d772ba32e9d84ab5a5d65c93ba221dd667a066ce95b5869ad89f65c2f21718\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-f793dea335f81218053d\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker><marker id=\"arrow-end-740f77b4ba30c8f7b6f9\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"f793dea335f81218053d\" transform=\"translate(2425700 165100)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 4445 371475\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-f793dea335f81218053d)\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"740f77b4ba30c8f7b6f9\" transform=\"translate(1498601 183516)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(463550 146050) rotate(0) scale(-1 1) translate(-463550 -146050)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 927100 292100\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-740f77b4ba30c8f7b6f9)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"da71ec05187f12aae802a809\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-022\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Venography\tstart anti \u2013 coagulant + repeat test in 1 week        +\t\t+ve\t\t-veContinue\t\tdiscontinue Anticoagulation\tanticoagulation\" viewbox=\"733425 228600 2924175 2400300\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"54774d41385a4027a4043eee619f3a1f741a94f3e11c782e30f4e9e96111d846\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"d39769799fe99480a200\" transform=\"translate(736600 233680)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2921000 0 L 2921000 2387600 L 0 2387600 Z\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-opacity=\"0\" stroke-width=\"6350\"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor=\"t\" transform=\"translate(0 45720)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"91440\" y=\"152400\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"152400\">Venography    start anti \u2013 coagulant + </tspan></text><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"1\" x=\"1005840\" y=\"329565\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"152400\">repeat test in 1 week</tspan></text><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"91440\" y=\"608330\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"152400\" font-weight=\"700\">        +    </tspan></text><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"91440\" y=\"785495\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"152400\">    +ve        -ve</tspan></text><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"91440\" y=\"962660\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"></text><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"91440\" y=\"1139825\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"152400\">Continue        discontinue </tspan></text><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"91440\" y=\"1316990\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"152400\">Anticoagulation    </tspan><tspan font-size=\"127000\">anticoagulation</tspan></text><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"91440\" y=\"1494155\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"></text></g></g></g></svg></figure>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"f9d39baa0d2b97a0eb40f0c8\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-022\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure f9d39baa0d2b97a0eb40f0c8\" viewbox=\"866775 66675 247650 1228725\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"15e8a99cc0b3cee9de5ac88367e09d729e530af8e8335863ea74cf6dfe08ff65\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-f5b4a559564eac33debf\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"f5b4a559564eac33debf\" transform=\"translate(988398 119306)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(7928 533840.5) rotate(0) scale(-1 1) translate(-7928 -533840.5)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 15856 1067681\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-f5b4a559564eac33debf)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"e9104ff11041c449c8edf05b\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-022\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure e9104ff11041c449c8edf05b\" viewbox=\"1733550 19050 1133475 514350\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"93717e09b8af67f0034a6157111a7e08d14ae89d8fc8c0530a329684f2dee547\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-666d715661371d219b39\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker><marker id=\"arrow-end-13fcfb785a4a3cfbe1f2\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"666d715661371d219b39\" transform=\"translate(2743200 67945)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 4445 371475\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-666d715661371d219b39)\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"13fcfb785a4a3cfbe1f2\" transform=\"translate(1854200 67945)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 4445 371475\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-13fcfb785a4a3cfbe1f2)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"9556be0230c3bb20a38be4f4\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-022\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 9556be0230c3bb20a38be4f4\" viewbox=\"981075 200025 1876425 409575\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"e0bd7a9530e1f8c36d121164e89c7f5cf73e7ffc11a874b4d99d34e0088b911a\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-cc9a273e380aba352bf0\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"cc9a273e380aba352bf0\" transform=\"translate(2730500 296545)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(8572.5 101600) rotate(0) scale(-1 1) translate(-8572.5 -101600)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 17145 203200\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-cc9a273e380aba352bf0)\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"b344cea40b479ba186cb\" transform=\"translate(990600 207645)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(355600 0) rotate(0) scale(-1 1) translate(-355600 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 711200 1\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9189]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9190]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9191]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Venography \u2013 as explained in the chart</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9192]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>MR venography or contrast venography</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9193]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>In iliac vein thrombosis (back pain + entire limb swelling)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9194]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4. D \u2013 dimer \u2013 assist</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> in clinical diagnosis.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9195]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Levels =&gt; exclude VTE</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"ea7ba5f90c7a0bc7285e3986\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-022\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure ea7ba5f90c7a0bc7285e3986\" viewbox=\"742950 -28575 247650 314325\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"4df11e03a4ec0137dfb2fcef1ef19519193f0fe8d980239dd3e554b4e4957a55\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-fe9b27db85c6eb588b51\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#000000\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"fe9b27db85c6eb588b51\" transform=\"translate(864235 24971)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 6350 158750\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-fe9b27db85c6eb588b51)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9196]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4 \u2013 17 % VTE not identified by D \u2013 dimer</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9197]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CTPA vs radionuclide V/Q scan.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"mm-table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:84.75pt;\"><col style=\"width:82.35pt;\"><col style=\"width:84.4pt;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-mm-row-height-twips=\"410\" data-mm-row-height-rule=\"auto\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><strong>Parameter</strong></span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><strong>CTPA</strong></span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><strong>V/Q</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>1. Radiation dose</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>High (20msv)</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Low</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>2. Absorbed dose to breast</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>10mGY </span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>0.28mGY</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>3. Risk of LA breast</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>13.6%</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>1/200 (background risk)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>4. 1</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><sup>st</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> choice investigation</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Gold standard in diagnosis of pulmonary embolism</span></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:88.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>- In young women.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>- Who had CT in past</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>- FH of CA breast</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9198]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Pulmonary embolism</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9199]\" style=\"margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Symptoms:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9200]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cough </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9201]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>SOB</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9202]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pleutritic chest pain</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9203]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Haemoptysis</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9204]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fever</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9205]\" style=\"margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Signs:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9206]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tachycardia </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9207]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tachypnoea</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9208]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Low SPO</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sub>2</sub></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9209]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Low grade pyrexia</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9210]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ECG changes (S</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sub>1</sub></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Q</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sub>2</sub></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> T</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sub>3</sub></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>) Non specific</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9211]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Plueral rub</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9212]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fine crepitation @ base of lu</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ngs</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9213]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9214]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9215]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Emergency with high mortality</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9216]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ICU admission</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9217]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>MDT involvement </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9218]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Full anticoagulation</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9219]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Understanding of recurrent factor.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9220]\" style=\"background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Tahoma\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>17.6. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Tahoma\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>SEPSIS:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9221]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hospital acquired infection 7%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9222]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Upto 15% in low and middle income countries</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9223]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Sepsis six</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"9e621704b6f5936b60b272a2\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-022\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 9e621704b6f5936b60b272a2\" viewbox=\"-180975 -161925 3524250 4229100\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"17e5e82c04c73fc72d08cdf6e8bfc691ecba892095ca613102543f433361230e\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-f1f4a40deee5e3d6e91b\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 3207419 0 L 3207419 3885913 L 0 3885913 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"f1f4a40deee5e3d6e91b\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-f1f4a40deee5e3d6e91b)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/d88fafede32ca30aa34f5e5e616586ba8ce3ddeb984cb39c9f30105d2549d241.jfif\" x=\"0\" y=\"-1153001.13295825\" width=\"3207419\" height=\"5753498.66745632\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 3207419 0 L 3207419 3885913 L 0 3885913 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"88900\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9225]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9226]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Same as other patients</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9227]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Broad spectrum antibiotics, Gentamicin is considered useful.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9228]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Genital sepsis is polymicobial infection</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9229]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Liasie with microbiologist</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9230]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Follow up treatment according to culture and sensitivities.</span></p>",
